# Installed by `npx impeccable install`: skills, agents, hooks and a compiled binary, ~28MB.
# Tooling for whoever is working here, not part of the product. The tracked .claude/workflows
# and .github/workflows are deliberately not covered by these.
.claude/agents/
.claude/skills/
.github/agents/
.github/hooks/
.github/skills/

# Impeccable run artifacts. The design record (.impeccable/design.json) and critique snapshots are tracked;
# screenshots and the throwaway preview page are not.
.impeccable/critique-shots/
.impeccable/after-shots/
.impeccable/preview/
